From: Bertrand Marquis <bertrand.marquis@arm.com>
Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 11:47:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] virtio_msg: add bus queue helper

Add a generic virtio message bus queue helper that providers can opt into
when they need FIFO handoff from non-sleepable paths to sleepable bus
submission context.

The helper is intentionally bus-owned: it copies complete messages,
enforces caller-provided depth and head timeout bounds, and invokes only a
bus-supplied submit callback. It does not allocate or validate tokens,
manage request completion, call provider operations directly, or coalesce
events.

Signed-off-by: Bertrand Marquis <bertrand.marquis@arm.com>
---
